  playButton: {fileID: 396293913}
  screen: {fileID: 1397955811}
  radio: {fileID: 1154010153}
  french: "Ing. Ines Vald\xE8s \u2014 Jour 212.\nLes digicodes ont \xE9t\xE9 r\xE9initialis\xE9s
    apr\xE8s la coupure. Par s\xE9curit\xE9, chaque code s'affiche dans le module
    d'\xE0 c\xF4t\xE9. Personne ne peut sortir seul d'ici. C'\xE9tait voulu."
  english: "Eng. Ines Vald\xE8s \u2014 Day 212.\nThe keypads were reset after the
    blackout. For safety, each code is shown in the next module. Nobody can get out
    of here alone. That was the point."
  charactersPerSecond: 28
